  "body": "The first beta. Multi-token sends work again, collectibles are easier to browse, and there is a guided way to split tokens out of a box.\n\n## ⚠️ This does not install over alpha builds\n\nEvery alpha was signed with a development key that no longer exists. Beta.1 is signed with a new, permanent release key, and Android will refuse to install it over any alpha.\n\nNew signing certificate, SHA-256:\n`E5:8B:18:35:B7:D5:F3:2A:C9:83:08:29:EC:94:9F:8D:D9:C6:2C:20:64:AD:89:E1:97:35:33:17:7D:B4:7F:CC`\n\n## What changed\n\n**Multi-token sends.** Sending tokens failed because the app expected a single recipient where the core returns a list.\n\n**Clipboard checks** now compare against every recipient you typed, not just the first.\n"
